summary:
  A Deezer answer that carries an error is read as "nothing found".

history:
  Deezer reports a quota or rate problem as 200 with {"error"}. Read as
  an answer, it files the song as one nobody has for half an hour, and with
  the stand-ins it also lets a picture of the artist be filed as final
  although the song search never answered. This mutant reads the error as
  an empty answer.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ArtworkEngine.qml

find:
              return data.error ? undefined : SearchLogic.artFromDeezerSongs(data, want);

replace:
              return SearchLogic.artFromDeezerSongs(data, want);

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_artworkengine.qml::test_one_service_not_answering_leaves_the_question_open.
  Line-neutral.
